g","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:52:07-08:00","id":61913,"title":"","content":"An infant primordial is that even possible !? I thought pimordials came all at once, like just came as they always will be. Willy wonka cookiemonster !? (can't stop laughing)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T20:16:00-08:00","id":61954,"title":"","content":"I'm a little confused. So, Jin and Amelia just sailed off to a tower?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T21:03:51-08:00","id":61976,"title":"","content":"Yes, yes we did. However, given that the sailing off to the tower was after Jin commed the rest of the Circle, I think its open enough to say that Pellias came with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T07:31:23-08:00","id":62154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/56130-ooc-exalted-2-5-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=61913#post61913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An infant primordial is that even possible !? I thought pimordials came all at once, like just came as they always will be. Willy wonka cookiemonster !? (can't stop laughing)</div> </div> </div> </div>While certain sources seem to say this, the Legend of Titans and the fact that Gaia and Autochthon both have a smaller number of component souls suggests that they can grow and evolve, so I say it could be either way. Hence, Palanmas' status as &quot;Infant.&quot; Granted, an infant Titan is a mite different than say, an infant human, as you'll see.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:49:00-08:00","id":62253,"title":"","content":"Sorry about the late posting. Babies have been sick and I've been busy. I'm here now though! ST feel free to just stick me at the current time, unless you need to edit me in for the scene to work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:53:47-08:00","id":62260,"title":"","content":"What are you talking about, Albz? You've been there the entire time!<br /> <br /> (Laugh track)<br /> <br /> It's fine, and I hope your kids are feeling better. We've been playing fast and loose with who's where and when, so it's all good. I'll just assume you're there with Jin, Pellias and Amelia.<br /> <br /> @Magnusar: I hope it doesn't seem like you're being cheated. I thought about your wish, and really thought about Palanmas' level of power, and concluded that whatever power-up you'd get would be trumped by the inherent excellence of your Solar Exaltation. So, I hope you don't feel jilted at all; that's not my intent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:02:18-08:00","id":62269,"title":"","content":"ok, let me edit my post a bit then. Also, are these beings all speaking Old Realm?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:12:22-08:00","id":62277,"title":"","content":"No problem I already knew that the answer my wish was not gonna do anything so I came up with another nice to see you Albz !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:17:40-08:00","id":62281,"title":"","content":"@Albz: Yes, all the beings are speaking Realm.<br /> <br /> @Magnusar: That's good to hear. I'd hate to get anyone's hopes up and then dash them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:20:30-08:00","id":62285,"title":"","content":"another question (sorry catching up from my hiatus) Would Voice have had the opportunity to learn any of the regional languages from the Spiral? Or is info too spotty for that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:23:34-08:00","id":62289,"title":"","content":"Yes, that's fine, Albz. Like I said before, Solar and Lunar linguists know of them and can speak them fluently, so it'd be reasonable to think you could do so, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T16:50:55-08:00","id":62568,"title":"","content":"Finished up and posted my Backstory. finally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T16:54:52-08:00","id":62569,"title":"","content":"Cool, thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T19:39:31-08:00","id":62687,"title":"","content":"Dietaku could you enlighten me on some of the technologies we have at our disposal, Hoshi contacted us in our armor do we have a form of communicator ? do mundane firearms exist or just artifact ones ? Is there anything else that we have access to that you put in the game that is not normally available ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-31-2014, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T22:30:52-08:00","id":62733,"title":"","content":"I assume your powered armors have essence radios, or Voxcasting Relays, if we need Exalted-y names, which is how Hoshi contacted you. I'm going under the assumption that each sworn brotherhood of DBs has one, too. As per firearms, all firearms are available, and I'm going under the assumption that the DBs are using a combination of mundane and artifact firearms, essence cannons, and melee weapons of various stripes, depending on their specialization. <br /> <br /> Ah, another thing that I assumed your squads have is the All-Sensing Machine Sages, a means for your squads to analyze and identify unknown lifeforms and materials. They're small , floating machine gods that, if you think of a Tricorder from Star Trek, wouldn't be far off the mark.<br /> <br /> I'm also going under the assumption that at least modern military levels of communication and coordination,, if not better. I can't think of anything off the top of my head, but I'm open if you really desire one tool or another. I'll be open to suggestion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T14:03:16-08:00","id":64299,"title":"","content":"I think perhaps it would be best if I withdrew from this game. I did not expect a play by post game to be this fast paced, and now that I have had the first chance to sign on in a few days and see how much I have missed, I would just be slowing you guys down. I apologize for the inconvenience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T14:45:16-08:00","id":64323,"title":"","content":"Ah, I apologize, Jim, Things have been moving much faster than even I had anticipated. I'm sorry to hear you go, but if you're still interested, I'm sure we can work something out. I'd hate for all that work you did on your character to go to waste.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T15:24:15-08:00","id":64344,"title":"","content":"I can slow down if you want me to dietaku","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T15:39:42-08:00","id":64358,"title":"","content":"Yeah, let's slow down a little. I don't want to lose anyone. I appreciate everyone's enthusiasm, but I don't want to lose anyone else to our breakneck speed, okay?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T15:50:55-08:00","id":64364,"title":"","content":"There is problems I'll post slowly I've got other exalted and RPG things going so it's okay for me to slow down I'll post back in a couple of days see ya !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T17:26:13-08:00","id":64442,"title":"","content":"Okay, then. I hope you have fun with your other games, too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T20:02:39-08:00","id":64532,"title":"","content":"No, thank you for the offer, but I'd feel bad holding you guys up. You seem to be doing OK without me, so please do go on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T20:20:46-08:00","id":64539,"title":"","content":"Nah don't worry about it, I'm on a writing spree these days it's the reason I post so often, Dietaku's game got me working on a couple of exalted gunstar things I came up with, like ships, planets, weapons so If i ever feel like make my own game I'll have a few things ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T20:33:35-08:00","id":64545,"title":"","content":"Well, in that case, fire away, Mr. Magnusar. Also, feel free to lift ideas. My group's idea is that any and all homages/satires are fair game, and I feel the same way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T08:53:54-08:00","id":64876,"title":"","content":"I do find it amusing how I've all but set up a sign saying &quot;THIS GUY IS BAD NEWS&quot; and yet y'all have been super-polite to him. Pretty funny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T09:07:35-08:00","id":64890,"title":"","content":"Well in my case I played for time until the others arrived.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T09:29:41-08:00","id":64917,"title":"","content":"In my case I decided to rip his throat out because he's an annoying arse. And My Motivation demands that he die AFTER he's put into fate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T13:51:42-08:00","id":65112,"title":"","content":"Question: how many beasts are in the area?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T15:00:40-08:00","id":65167,"title":"","content":"I'd say about a magnitude 5 level force. <br /> <br /> The DelArm force deployed is about magnitude 3 at present. You could call for more, but they'd take a bit to deploy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T19:52:27-08:00","id":65327,"title":"","content":"Directed towards the other Players: Maybe we can call in some Voidfighter Air support?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T21:37:07-08:00","id":65385,"title":"","content":"I'm actually finding it hard to decide what to do next and where to fit in on this. We've gone from a mission of secrecy to suddenly fighting Evil Cavedude going supersaiyan. Are we in combat? Are we bothereing with initiatives?<br /> <br /> Do we really want to just start blasting the face of the planet of all its inhabitants?<br /> <br /> Clarification edit: not unhappy with the turn of events, just moved rather fast to where we are now and I'm hashing out what the hell I can do to fit in on this scene besides simple *pew pew* posts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2059,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","user":"Jotun","date":". 02-05-2014, 12:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T21:58:19-08:00","id":65398,"title":"","content":"You're not in combat yet, so initiative isn't a thing yet. The Beast King is at something of a disadvantage, with his throat crippled, but being king, he can't very well just up and retreat, at least not yet. Thus, his Shintai.<br /> <br /> If you want me to, I could be a bit more descriptive so we could avoid this misunderstanding in the future.<br /> <br /> It's up to you all if you want to take the challenge or to retreat and assess the situation: I'm not trying to push you into any one situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T22:12:06-08:00","id":65410,"title":"","content":"I'll admit, that part of that was me. However, given Jin's Motivation, to go in line with it when encountering an enemy Celestial Exalt, he has two potential options: (1) Recruit (2) Put within Fate then kill. Interactions with Enien fulfilled number 1 (provisionally), and I judged that we wouldn't get anywhere with trying to recruit Caveman King... plus he pissed me off IC, so I tried to act the part of a pissed Person-of-Mass-Destruction. <br /> <br /> Not suggesting orbital bombardment, or killing all the inhabitants. Just mobilizing some Voidfighters to provide close Air support to the DelArm detachment, in case the beast army attacks them. <br /> <br /> I fully intend to kill the Caveman King, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T11:21:42-08:00","id":65827,"title":"","content":"Well I hope my trick work... if not It will be the lamest fight ever for a dawn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-05-2014, 04:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T12:17:44-08:00","id":65855,"title":"","content":"To confirn the situation in space, the bird monsters are attcking the ship which is firing back with its cannons. No voidfighters have been scrambled yet though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T12:32:00-08:00","id":65867,"title":"","content":"That's right, no fighters have been scrambled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T14:02:51-08:00","id":65941,"title":"","content":"How far off is the pyramid covered in this guy's name? 60 miles or so? Is the pyramid destructible (or at least appearing as such)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T17:19:38-08:00","id":66098,"title":"","content":"The pyramid, insofar as your inspection revealed, seems to be made of hewn granite, so tough, but destructible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T09:00:09-08:00","id":66523,"title":"","content":"So It was not needed to shoot at the demo charges ?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/56130-ooc-exalted-2-5-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=64545#post64545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, in that case, fire away, Mr. Magnusar. Also, feel free to lift ideas. My group's idea is that any and all homages/satires are fair game, and I feel the same way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you mean to post some of my stuff here ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T09:28:24-08:00","id":66534,"title":"","content":"No, not really. They're bombs, after all.<br /> <br /> What I meant was, you could take any ideas you like for your game. Although, if you want to post them here, that's fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T10:18:23-08:00","id":66554,"title":"","content":"Waste of essence then but it was still cool in my head at least, thanks but I don't like using other people stuff to make my own and you're ideas are cool but most of my stuff is made for Essence 6+ game it's mostly hardware,artifact and planets and is set after the war when the exalted sail across the cosmos to submit the worlds of the spiral. I did however made Amelia's flagship just for the fun of it, I don't think I'll ever use it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-06-2014, 01:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T12:12:51-08:00","id":69285,"title":"","content":"Sorry about disappearing. I had a lot of work this weekend. I updated the IC thread, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T12:39:47-08:00","id":69956,"title":"","content":"No worries about the pause. That's one of the benefits/luxuries of PbP!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T18:43:46-08:00","id":70224,"title":"","content":"Ah, thanks. A thought that has been percolating in my head, though. Since you all seem to have (Somewhat) recruited a Dement, do you want me to reveal my Oramus charmset?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T19:43:14-08:00","id":70243,"title":"","content":"I'm interested in seeing i","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T07:14:40-08:00","id":70569,"title":"","content":"Alrighty, then. It's your turn in the battle, Magnusar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T15:38:34-08:00","id":72276,"title":"","content":"hey Dietaku, What is an Akasa?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T22:45:04-08:00","id":72480,"title":"","content":"Akasa is an element (as in base material, not a section of) in certain sects of Buddhism that is immutable and divine in origin. Sound is a derivative of this material, hence why it reacted to the Daevas' sonic attack, and kinda why I added it; as a means to explain sonic attacks working in the void, what with none of that &quot;Air&quot; stuff getting in the way.<br /> <br /> It is really just a flavor detail, though, nothing that should impede you or your soldiers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T05:35:43-08:00","id":72557,"title":"","content":"Ah gotcha. So not something I can shoot then","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T21:27:52-08:00","id":72993,"title":"","content":"Well, sorta. You can interact with it, definitely, and stunting off of it would be highly favorable for your stunt's power. I just didn't want to drown out anything you had in mind with what amounts to &quot;Magic Space Dust.&quot; &quot;However, if you do tricks off it, well, that DOES count as using the environs...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T07:49:11-08:00","id":83944,"title":"","content":"Sorry about the wait. Here is the initial charms I have for Oramus. I'll hold off on the others for now, as you all seem to be speculating at the extent of Enien's power.<br /> <br /> Down of Koans Unanswered<br /> Cost: 3m(+1m)<br /> Min: Essence 1<br /> Type: Reflexive<br /> Duration: Indefinite<br /> Keywords: Combo-OK, Obvious<br /> Prereqs: None<br /> While he first arose in the infinite possibilities of the Wyld, Oramus is neither constrained nor burdened by the madness of that realm, his lustrous down shielding from all but the most apocalyptic shaping. When a Titanic Exalt purchases this charm, they can ignore the effects of environmental shaping so long as they commit the essence. Purchasing this charm again allows the Exalt to render themselves immune to all shaping actions as long as they commit the essence to the charm.<br /> <br /> Sight Beyond Sight Prana<br /> Cost: 3m (+1m)<br /> Min: Essence 2<br /> Type: Supplemental<br /> Duration: Instant<br /> Keywords: Combo-OK, Obvious,<br /> Prereqs: Down of Koans Unasnwered<br /> Oramus' senses aren't constrained by time and space, but by the perceptions of others. The Exalt can add their essence to rolls to detect or sense something. However, for ever y other character in the scene, the Exalt must add an additional mote, as their extra perspectives distort the supernal sight Oramus grants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T15:07:23-08:00","id":84874,"title":"","content":"Should we hold up on IC posting until any interest in the game (re: new recruitment drive) has cropped up over a few days? Or do you have plans for mid-story introduction if we head to another location?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T20:29:38-08:00","id":85036,"title":"","content":"It's fine, Things can continue as you all like. I'm just offering those who wish it to join in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T14:57:35-08:00","id":87024,"title":"","content":"Sorry to have been in and out the last few days (been sporatically busy). Before I just spot answer the &quot;where are we going&quot; question, what do we think? I reckon the Western Arm location may be a bit more strategic as far as mission goals go (re: further from the Pleasure Planet) but it also sounds a bit more random and perhaps less plot-hookey. Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T17:35:52-07:00","id":89134,"title":"","content":"Sorry about the lack of replies. I'm not trying to pusch you guys in any one direction, and if you need reminders about what you know about the other planets, i can post them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-11T18:10:39-07:00","id":89147,"title":"","content":"Sure that would help a lot. I'll post an answer in a day or two (My boss is a slaver in disguise) but I would like to get the opinion of the others about whats going on, what they want to do and etc, so that we could focus our effort, if you don't mind Dietaku ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-11-2014, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T07:19:58-07:00","id":89457,"title":"","content":"That's fine. I'd much prefer you all discuss it than I try to get it moving for my own sake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T16:43:47-07:00","id":90496,"title":"","content":"Alright then their are a few question that I wanted to ask for now here's two<br /> <br /> 1. Do the people of the spiral uses technologies like the one we a have access to or are they more &quot;alien&quot; than that ? (Guns, communicator, etc)<br /> 2. What do know about the infernal as a whole ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T20:48:51-07:00","id":90612,"title":"","content":"1) The technologies that you know are in use throughout the Spiral (Guns, essence radios, powered flight, etc.). However, much like how the Exalted use esoteric technologies for their individual weapons, many Peers and Untouchables use demontech much like how the MoEP: Infernals illustrates. However, this is all with that caveat that the Spiral is a massive place, and the technological levels of each planet may very well vary, with stone age servant races all the way up to technologically advanced Chosen who may put the Celestial Exalted to shame with their toys.<br /> 2) You know that, as far as the Deliberative can gather, there are about 600 Titanic Exalted, in about 45 Castes, each corresponding to a single Titan. In addition, there also Chosen of several new behemoth-goddesses called the Yazatas. The Yazatas are six in number, and they maintain the Khotep Tablet, a hypothetical name for a Fate Engine that would operate on the same function as the Loom of Fate in maintaining Causality. The Chosen of the Yazatas are unknown in number, but they seem to be approximately Celestial in power, although their encounters with the Gunstar fleets are few and far between.<br /> <br /> That is, unless you're referring to Enien herself, well, then you may have to ask her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 03-14-2014, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T21:28:56-07:00","id":90637,"title":"","content":"Put it this way, I'm happy to continue the &quot;explore and try to set up a base&quot; angle of the game and try for another potential planet. However, I also respect that we may have been tossed a plot-point in the Pleasure Planet.<br /> <br /> Really, don't mind where we go, in all honesty. Was there a jungle planet Dietaku?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T07:11:24-07:00","id":90877,"title":"","content":"For some reason that makes me happy as much as it worries me, I knew I should have use my combat twilight that would have been so much fun but I am pretty happy with Amelia.<br /> So us vs a galaxy full of infernals and some sort of weird copies of Siderals plus Devas ? Awesome!!! Now that's an Exalted game with normal odds <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> As for our next destination I have no idea I would like to know what Ocelot as to say but it could be a trap so I'm not sure.<br /> Dietaku I have other questions if you don't mind<br /> <br /> 1. Do we know how to build manse with powers like in oadenol codex since Autochtonia doesn't have dragon lines ?<br /> 2. Does a moon have dragon lines and demesne (maybe a stupid question but whatever) ?<br /> 3. Are there mundane tech starships or is it only the purview of magitech ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-14-2014, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T07:59:04-07:00","id":90898,"title":"","content":"@Jotun: I'm not really trying to draw you either way. I'm just offering a potential way you all can gallivant around the Spiral and not feel railroaded. As for a jungle planet, there is one. It's one of the two planets nearby on the Western Arm. <br /> <br /> @Magnusar: The numbers are due to the sheerly impossible size I feel the Spiral is. The Titans need a lot of Chosen to maintain it/ fight their war for them, and without the Maidens, things got more weird. True, the Titans COULD maintain Reality, but screw that. Hence, the large number of Titanic Exalts and the existence of the Yazatas and their Chosen. Now, to answer your questions:<br /> <br /> 1) The scientific and alchemical processes of creating and maintaining powerful manses are still maintained, so you have those processes if you'd want to do that.<br /> 2) All planets have Dragon Lines, along with even moons and dead asteroids. The ability to harness their power, though, may be more difficult than with others.<br /> 3) There are mundane starships, much as in Vanilla, there are mundane aircraft. These ships are slower and more unwieldy in their maneuvering, but they do exist, and if you want to move between planets, these are probably your best bet of doing so. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T15:01:44-07:00","id":91121,"title":"","content":"Noodle, Magnusar, does the jungle planet sound like a good next step then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T15:22:08-07:00","id":91131,"title":"","content":"I've go no problem with it but this time It's kill first and annihilate later, no talk and no waiting hope you don't have a problem with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T15:27:46-07:00","id":91135,"title":"","content":"Not sure I follow you. What are you wanting to kill?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T15:32:17-07:00","id":91137,"title":"","content":"Everything that poses a threat it's her motivation, If the beast planet would not have destroyed itself I was planing to use heavy bombardment on every volcano on the planet to cause them to erupt and cause a planetary disaster so yeah kill first and annihilate later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-14-2014, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T15:33:01-07:00","id":91139,"title":"","content":"Aren't we trying to settle on a planet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T16:28:14-07:00","id":91179,"title":"","content":"With the letter from ocelot I am more focused on remaining invisible to our enemies so I don't think that settling on a planet with a form of sentient beings is a good idea so if we do find a form of civilization on the planet we have to remain hidden from them or kill them if the are hostile, they must not reveal our presence to the primordials. Remember that we are behind enemy lines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T16:32:04-07:00","id":91183,"title":"","content":"Yeah, and I would be rather difficult to convince the natives that we're a liberating army if we go around destroying entire planets with sentient populations. Though I shouldn't be one to complain, because I kicked off a battle with a powerful Titanic Exalt because of Jin's Motivation. So, yeah, it would be hypocritical for me to complain. On the upside, I should have to deal with that for a bit, since I can focus Jin on trying to permanently recruit Enein (and my stick 'em in Fate, then cap 'em plan proved workable).<br /> <br /> Back to original query, Jotun, Jungle planet sounds good to me too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T16:35:12-07:00","id":91187,"title":"","content":"I suppose that we've lost our social-fu player as well, so we've little options other than remaining super covert or &quot;kill 'em all&quot; if we're found. Magnus, jungle planet ok?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T16:38:14-07:00","id":91190,"title":"","content":"Oops I thought that I had answer yeah no problem jungle planet it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T12:56:32-07:00","id":94397,"title":"","content":"Query, ST-man: I would like to have Jin learn a non-published Throne Shadow Charm. Is this okay:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Fateful Lotus Insight</b><br /> <b>Cost</b>: 5m, 1wp <b>Mins</b>: Martial Arts 5, Essence 3 <b>Type</b>: Reflexive (Step 1 Attacker, Step 2 Defender)<br /> <b>Keywords</b>: Combo-OK<br /> <b>Duration</b>: One Scene <br /> <b>Prerequisites</b>: Lotus Eye Tactics<br /> The Viziers have a the ability to intuitively understand any fighting style they see. It is a simple step to exploit this knowledge in combat. Reading their opponents movements, they know exactly where they will strike, and therefore, how to block it. Analyzing their opponent's stance, they know what points are most vulnerable, and therefore, where to best to strike. This charm allows the Sidereal to enter into a Trance-like state, gaining them these most-potent of insights. When active, this charm allows the Sidereal to add their (Essence) dice to any Throne Shadow-style attack, and adds +1 to their DVs against any opponent whose presence they are aware off.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T08:17:20-07:00","id":95651,"title":"","cont