ps://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T20:55:07-07:00","id":116319,"title":"","content":"Welcome aboard, Palemask. As per your character, as Noodle said earlier, both a sorcerer and a socialite are currently missing from the Circle, so whatever you'd want to do. Something to know before you go, though, is I'll allow Schaeffer Chargen rules for Lunars,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-21T12:31:35-07:00","id":117094,"title":"","content":"Okay!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VoqFTCd8FNDjBd1Vwxu-a7PJ3nTW1NiWcZLuzNTxhsI/edit\" target=\"_blank\">A link to my sheet here for people to gander at</a>! I present to you, Sweetsong Wren the social Sidereal of Endings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1148,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","user":"Palemask","date":". 04-24-2014, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T18:20:39-07:00","id":118827,"title":"","content":"Looks good, Palemask. I'll introduce you ASAP in-game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T07:45:49-07:00","id":119104,"title":"","content":"A'right, Palemask, I've introduced you into the scene. Feel free to act now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T17:28:47-07:00","id":119444,"title":"","content":"Posted. For some reason, phone browser won't let me edit. :/ (It just gives me a blank box) It should be &quot;Introductions, if you would so kindly.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T21:46:42-07:00","id":120152,"title":"","content":"It's cool. I got the gist of what you meant. Also, Noodle, not cool, man. At this rate people will get the joke outright.<br /> <br /> <br /> (Sigh)<br /> <br /> Rusemin=Rusemen=<a href=\"http://mspaintadventures.wikia.com/wiki/Troll\" target=\"_blank\"> Trolls</a>.<br /> <br /> I hate to explain it like this, but the cat is out of the bag now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T07:46:09-07:00","id":121694,"title":"","content":"Wren's idea is timed explosives in pitcher plants. For some reason, tossing a hologram of a &quot;wacky waving inflatable tube man&quot; also came to mind and made me giggle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T20:48:41-07:00","id":124958,"title":"","content":"Hahahaha, nice idea, Palemask. <br /> <br /> Anyways, good roleplaying, everyone, +1 Exp for that exchange.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T11:21:49-07:00","id":125251,"title":"","content":"I have a bad feeling about this... Zekka is out cold where stuck on a jungle planet full of man eating giants and infernals and Amelia is about to put a bullet into Tavren's head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T21:11:27-07:00","id":127968,"title":"","content":"Before we move on, is this an opportunity to split up and/or enact more than one plan? Or, rather, are you wanting us to keep together to keep the story a bit easier to tell/track?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T07:48:18-07:00","id":128232,"title":"","content":"It's the former rather than the latter. It's a combination of me realizing that much like the Sidereal charms that allow one to move through the Spirit World, Footsteps on Glass Practice is a GOOD charm, allowing you to quickly and safely bypass many obstacles, provided that you have a shaping defense. It's also me attempting as best I can to keep things moving but also not railroad you guys. I really don't want to do that.<br /> <br /> So, if you want to split up or make more plans, now would be a good time, and I'm interested in what ideas you all come up with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T12:24:21-07:00","id":129173,"title":"","content":"Noodle are you still with us ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:00:19-07:00","id":129283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/56130-ooc-exalted-2-5-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=129173#post129173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Noodle are you still with us ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. I just don't think that Jin would be all that willing to interpose himself into military panning and such. He's an intelligence operative, after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:39:06-07:00","id":129317,"title":"","content":"Well tactical planning needs intelligence and we will need you to plant spies on this planet and the others at some point if we do not blow it up first. Oh and this is probably not the place for this but I've been following Forging a nation and I love your work keep it up <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T22:11:24-07:00","id":129624,"title":"","content":"That's fine, Magnusar. Am I correct, though, with Enien's assumption?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T06:39:00-07:00","id":129851,"title":"","content":"Thanks Dietaku since I missed my chance of joining his game I've been following it. Enien's assumption is correct at least for Amelia's part though I'm not sure what Wren is gonna do in the mean time while we attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-10-2014, 03:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T09:04:57-07:00","id":133810,"title":"","content":"I am completely lost on where Wren is, whoops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T09:11:09-07:00","id":133822,"title":"","content":"You're with me outside with the turret shooting at us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T16:28:06-07:00","id":134618,"title":"","content":"Question to our illustrious ST: can I use my larceny to hack into systems like security and/or doors? Perhaps loot a database? Just wanting to know how you were dividing computer tasks and whether they're wholly within Lore or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T20:46:56-07:00","id":134950,"title":"","content":"Truth be told, I hadn't considered such a thing, but considering how Larceny is treated in the Solar/Sidereal charmsets as &quot;The Underhanded Ability,&quot; then I can see hacking as something one can do with it. Lore, as it pertains to computers, would be for normal usage (&quot;Push the start button to make it go,&quot; word processing, and the like), while Linguistics would be used for programming. Occult would be useful, too, especially, if one wanted to make artificial intelligences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T07:13:41-07:00","id":138014,"title":"","content":"I am using Orokos, due to Invisible Castle's authentication emails are broken. I've tried signing up several times, but Orokos seems to work much better. I've also heard other complaints about Invisible Castle consistently giving crap rolls, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T21:05:09-07:00","id":138868,"title":"","content":"No complaints here. I just used Invisiblecastle due to being aware of it. Truth be told, I use my own D10s when I gamed online most, and we all trusted one another, but I appreciate the heads-up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T09:53:37-07:00","id":143624,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://i880.photobucket.com/albums/ac10/Dietaku/Hellstriders.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> And lo, does Zephyr reveal her one true hobby. In her Temple-Manse on some far-off planet, you'll find entire galleries of exquisite models of notable war machines. From Ligier's own Greater Zakarthion to even minor beastlings like the Hackler's Rampaging ZeitJunger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 05-20-2014, 01:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T10:16:50-07:00","id":143656,"title":"","content":"Ok you really want me dead either that or Amelia is a bit more badass than I thought if you need to send a Hellstrider, if memory serves me right they are made of demons right ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T10:24:58-07:00","id":143680,"title":"","content":"I don't want you dead. I just realized with the Watchers that Amelia is tough as nails, so I needed to escalate a tad to compensate. Hellstriders are indeed made of the fused bodies of demons. Don't worry, though. I'm not trying to PK you; just provide a challenge. If I didn't think Amelia could handle it, I wouldn't have used it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T11:01:38-07:00","id":143715,"title":"","content":"I'm flattered <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, I have Essence gathering temper when I get hit I regain essence so if the watchers rushed me but couldn't get trough my armor did I get any overdrive essence ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T11:07:56-07:00","id":143717,"title":"","content":"According to Errata, you'd regain 4 motes, due to being hit, but not doing damage. I'd also like to note. that the damage you're being attacked with is also RAW damage, so you're actually looking at...2 Bashing if we take into account your full bashing soak. Go Celestial Battle Armor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/