t of social manoeuvring first? This plant-person seems nice enough, and we don't have any handy napalm on hand.</div> </div> </div> </div>Memo to self: check to see if Tannicks cam generate napalm or similar flammable substance....<br /> <br /> At the moment, I think killing the demon may be a bad idea? Unless we use a permakill charm (I don't have one, does anyone else?), then he'll reform and the Primordials will know what's going on. Social maneuvering may be the best option.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/56130-ooc-exalted-2-5-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=196197#post196197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do someone know if Palemask is still playing ? haven't seen him online in a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>As I recall, Palemask's in the process of a move. Seems like a good enough reason to not be posting at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T02:36:04-07:00","id":198750,"title":"","content":"I am similarly inept, Noodle. Pellias is pretty bad regarding the social arena when compared to other supernaturals. No perma-kill charms either.... Jarsiln social-fu maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},