 not play the person doing the talking. I will try to post in the enxt couple of days, but am a bit busy so it might not be up until Tuesday or Wednesday.<br /> <br /> Jarsiln's response will be something along the lines of &quot;we are explores, looking to revist the land of our ancesters.&quot; I will try to phrase it such that everything he says is technically the truth, even if he means the something else. I (player) am not very good at this kind of thing so feel free to offer advice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T11:57:35-07:00","id":219340,"title":"","content":"I think I ought to apologize to you all, but I think I should mention to everyone that, because of the lack of responses and everything, that, I feel that the game is more or less dead. I am glad that everyone had a good time, and I'm sorry to say this, but we have to face facts; this is something of a zombie at this point. If you're still interested in Exalted, I definitely recommend Noodle's game, or a few other's I've seen on RP Nation. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T03:12:06-07:00","id":220015,"title":"","content":"Well, thanks for the efforts Dietaku. Was fun while it lasted, and I certainly appreciate the creativity that went into this. Enjoy